      <comments xsi:type="java:Javadoc" originalCompilationUnit="//@compilationUnits.3" content="/** Representation for the ATM itself.  An object of this class &quot;owns&quot;&#xD; *  the objects representing the component parts of the ATM, and the&#xD; *  communications network, and is responsible for creating customer &#xD; *  sessions which then use it to gain access to the component parts.&#xD; *  This is an active class - when an instance of the class is created,&#xD; *  a thread is executed that actually runs the system.&#xD; */" prefixOfParent="true">
